<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#141519;">A family link was removed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">{{ if is_parent == "true" }}{{ other_name }} removed the link between your {{ brand }} accounts, so you no longer see their studies. If this is unexpected, talk to {{ other_name }}; they can link again with a new code or invite.{{ else }}{{ other_name }} removed the link between your {{ brand }} accounts, so they no longer see anything of yours.{{ end }}</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#c3e84f;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="{{ family_link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#141519;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Open your family page</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#4b4e4a;font-size:14px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<a href="{{ family_link }}" style="color:#141519;word-break:break-all;">{{ family_link }}</a></p>
